2eda32a05c5b600316c79650b3af09ba753","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You convert %d%% of all non-temporal damage you receive into temporal damage spread out over %d turns.\n\t\tThis damage will bypass resistance and affinity.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你将所有受到的 %d%% 的非时空伤害转化为时空伤害，分摊到 %d 回合承受。\n\t\t造成的伤害无视抗性和伤害亲和。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e4932091450fdd114e715fbb1acff3f7dadb09a26e2b3166a5efd439764e90aa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"39d90a61f24835d6652aea539f42df3322ba0e482da4e6e31edb59622e053e25","logical_entry_identity":"ebb6b84633e61bae3e1dc727673ab0f1e12c7d7c7305dc1b072d5ad45e9b33b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Target# has been harassed.","source_tag":"_t","target":"#Target#受到骚扰。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"03e53c67b544f05448e8747b530d0f7498ca51fc41ba299c47ae0bcf5b1042e1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"4eddf5831cdfe877dda752c3f174b310d21d8d5055966f3a7ddc12296d865798","logical_entry_identity":"b416f8e7bada07dabc5375e5e1d6d4be76d13b005b9e33c230327f467485f8aa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"sacrificing %s for the sake of the world","source_tag":"tformat","target":"为了世界牺牲了%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"93e4b12e38d78675ef74ecb1aaffe9dcd67b46c35703d8c894479557841b06e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"532d8c98d0a296c385da397058b00607734237a4e8c42776746435ed0d095647","logical_entry_identity":"66f7cba4228fc0bb815784da324091eaa861f5891520a89806b047425d8fe814","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Years of magic have permeated your skin leaving it resistant to the physical world. Your armor is increased by %d.\n\t\tThe bonus will increase with the Magic stat.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"魔法渗透进你的皮肤，使之能抵御外部世界的侵蚀。护甲值增加 %d。\n\t\t增益效果受魔力值加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a18a8eb7adbbb5ba1305b0fc47a163f5f39711013d34466caa0853f4e2b97117","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"59729d0ebdb67dcde8dcc0c038e5eff0cd80bd698e2a3ee1f39dfcad1b9b664b","logical_entry_identity":"05df2be83052156ef919c209ca3238562e730d9cac7d628989a729f78d1c82b3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rolf,\n\nI can't remember anything from the fight save the sheer terror at being near something so horrid and powerful. There is no shame in running from a foe you cannot possibly hope to defeat, is there? Maybe ale from the tavern is a good idea, but maybe it is better to conquer your fear once and for all... I hope you can forgive me, but I must defeat this monster, if it takes me the rest of my life.\n\nWishing you and your ale a hearty good-bye,\n\nWeisman.","source_tag":"_t","target":"罗尔夫，\n\n那场战斗我什么都不记得了，唯一记得的就是靠近那个恐怖而强大的东西时的纯粹恐惧。在根本不可能战胜的敌人面前逃跑，不丢人吧？去客栈喝麦酒也许是个好主意，但也许彻底战胜自己的恐惧才是更好的选择……希望你能原谅我，但我必须打倒这个怪物，哪怕穷尽余生。\n\n衷心祝你和你的麦酒一切安好，就此别过，\n威斯曼。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"00dc714d5f6032c44011ac167641b9cbfed6279ac35fb3353103e1e34de639c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"59d0094f47dd6ff916cffb7d8a83a29174c3981d530759cc76f0f460c412c460","logical_entry_identity":"debe3faec2e4c0c301d9c838879925afdf4463d56d12cb17e0d8ee40e3e15861","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You require two melee weapons to use this talent.","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"你需要双持近战武器才能使用这个技能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"19290dffcc7a6c71357b2f6091a05aaf5e0d1450faa128b3a8c48e70d4825328","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5bb182aa01a05875db2ccdfae73946c4ec331a7cdc44eb1bf4b6e7f81fe87865","logical_entry_identity":"24fc548a944a014a173102520877966b1a7780c496c57bfce8e942449718282c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You tried to kill yourself to prevent you from doing something, or going somewhere... you were not very clear.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"你尝试杀掉自己，以阻止自己做某件事，或去往某个地方……你说得不太清楚。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15e81473e2774fe0eb18e8e88fd3be5155d09ecaea928e2a69d3a503158b2c80","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5feeb4648343ddffc59ce73891223ba9f87dc9bd258bd064b82240041cb91ded","logical_