守卫最初的年代。对于未经训练的持有者来说它还不是那么完善；对于时空守卫来说，它代表着时间尚未开发的潜能。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"24b1d76f8a1b065e06ffa92c99a1e06f58900ab5404d43cb0ff8afa131a114a1","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"994d058b0b1ab2674b9234ae2d92ed641162ae6a509b59085bb354e903978bc5","logical_entry_identity":"3c07794746f60e203d90a206ae52ac1e0bfdf933ce7f06a83f9def06c8dc9961","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You cannot use Assault without a mainhand weapon and shield!","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"没有主手武器和盾牌，无法使用强袭！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"164ef10c3e05eb9b29fafa045042c6487d3ce553564d62d773e52fe701820bca","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9dd12ab5c8ebb2f5db939496b950d1442f4de90ff06d45257b250053b09fc372","logical_entry_identity":"4a3c619cfd4cfe15856a4e29a4f94f8575f7a2cf82d5c78261f0add5a046868c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Magically frozen wound that deals %0.2f cold damage per turn and movement speed reduced by %d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"被魔法冻结的伤口，每回合受到 %0.2f 寒冷伤害，移动速度降低 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64fe2ada4247b117fc490aa5f814e8d9f82ebcd4470438cf9ce467ab480cb1bf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3c2103cc06c7217fb526db9c54a39f96b7947214792c004b0d5d563e63d203b","logical_entry_identity":"7b07ab781d0bce72122f2bea621e9c6bcb1a34c820c840b5571503f74ed3044e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Inner Demons","source_tag":"talent name","target":"心魔"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"2eaa881fdd13278641a2c8eef84ee469e54c6e44ce8e0e6a3553dd4061b827e2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3c2987eb936953f7298dd979c82aea723870fa433da1ff2cd87d2ede7f5f9e3","logical_entry_identity":"467d4e22de15dce1a65749ddfca64583528605f568482498fc9758840c00a0e6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You fire a mighty shot at your target, doing %d%% damage and knocking it back.\n\t\tThe knockback chance increases with your Accuracy.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你射出一发强力的子弹，对目标造成 %d%% 伤害并击退目标。\n\t\t击退概率受命中加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0cc616e2e52e332806f5cd616d85dffb1042208df22cfc4fcb338a31b874aa36","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3c50760ba5b1901dd4e85e0d76a803620c7c55d2c51ac30cb929833ef5f633d","logical_entry_identity":"4c513f2f836f627dbfbaec381bc9d3565da13970dfcc40664041154b614c7099","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Clear Object","source_tag":"_t","target":"清除物品"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"79d3dab23c8d683980923910ef815e11c4acfd0bcf644ce9809ada0df2a9dc39","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3c527ec8984c9457e3535756e05f87aba96e9036df3d7fc4b5ca192aa3e0827","logical_entry_identity":"4a70a8a4d7c4c293cf5aacee742db1accb28aafd6417b749acd40bd52e8c8c8e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Use finely controlled forces to augment both your flesh-and-blood grip, and your telekinetic grip. This does the following:\n\t\tIncreases disarm immunity by %d%%.\n\t\tAllows %d%% of Willpower and Cunning (instead of the usual 60%%) to be substituted for Strength and Dexterity for the purposes of determining damage done by telekinetically-wielded weapons.\n\t\tAt talent level 5, telekinetically wielded gems and mindstars will be treated as one material level higher than they actually are.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用细致的操控来增加你的肉体支配和灵能支配。此技能有以下效果：\n\t\t增加 %d%% 缴械免疫。\n\t\t当使用灵能武器造成伤害时，用 %d%% 意志和灵巧（通常60%%）来代替力量和敏捷决定伤害。\n\t\t在等级5时，意念装备的宝石或灵晶的品质提升一级。\n\t\t"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"093fd554afcfa7b44cc08659bc05bcc89071e902b67d1e18e4fc83176831625b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3c84150d5d84572109fe4fa3efdb880f224766c88cf7e0e659da50f5bd0e5c2","logical_entry_identity":"d4d3b536aebefb4ef4ca23f3dcf9e0b94ffd3448ea3ebf7df499db38fc4c7cc9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Light damage has been increased by %d%% to +%d%%.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"光系伤害加成增加了 %d%%，变成 +%d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"825516b50d371a46f5b3f989054a346003391a78ceaf0c15c28d39f6f22eb320","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3ca0dc8dada9f1a42c996de603cb6b115ff1ce5db1eb5cd3e9d7c99a2202529","logical_entry_identity":"036b8cec3a5c7ce4ab28126519a127a03b943b9ec7481c609e0607ca2efb5751","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ah yes, you seem to master the simple art of alchemy. I can change the chest to automatically use your power to extract a gem if the transmogrification of the gem would reward more energy.\nHowever, I will need to use 25 energy to do this.","source_tag":"_t","target":"啊，是的，你似乎已经掌握了简单的炼金术。如果提取出的宝石经转化后能提供更多能量，我可以改造转化之盒，让它自动借助你的力量提取宝石。\n不过，我需要消耗 25 点能量来完成改造。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8136fdbcb45e35a82991310813582d148a2543e245c02a99b1f96b3f43009ede","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3cf954a9d6c52a8ab198d41b39ba7fc9c4ac97cee7bf9be2b3a5ad62cca40c8","logical_entry_identity":"795a9845b7b339332d4531b1b46d8b69d82b148fab9005b3fa1f401e2ee69356","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"firestorm","source_tag":"_t","target":"火焰风暴"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"58e6d40fba11cc56d0b2622d69d78fb0c7f109ffd7bbcc35a3bddbd8a0704e68","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3dce6672333fe446e2c175fde599ff6b3ce786f73303e4ff2737979dac8cc88","logical_entry_identity":"fd9b3f74e1913dda11823f2d557bf75cb3ecd6bcc347b5d2ccdf6b27a361ca09","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Displaying talents (#{bold}##GOLD#%s#LAST##{normal}#)\nToggle for creature display","source_tag":"tformat","target":"显示技能 (#{bold}##GOLD#%s#LAST##{normal}#)\n切换到生物显示。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5c192b82c89c7a19f31fef5e2cec8e86b181d5bf84eaf895e94d8c1955c83abe","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3e314eb1d7d7cccf0eb54f7a8f9c5fdc3aba840ee14fc87a12d492f8a389351","logical_entry_identity":"3c7b7828c60162c71c95d3fe52a92f36f401162af8178c5d8558cbcc9dac2d0e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The heart of the Sandworm Queen, ripped from her dead body.\nYou could ... consume it, should you feel mad enough or you could try to corrupt it somewhere.","source_tag":"_t","target":"从沙虫女皇尸体上割下的心脏。\n你可以……吃了它，如果你足够疯的话，你还可以在别的地方腐化它。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ee71496b2e11950ce1de79c028aa4b3e2786b97a13f68673c0bebf3c6a9dcece","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3e570108ef4de73ebf2d0eaaff4c140c124044e78812911b41f81addf6f81f7","logical_entry_identity":"f28196ec060211e8605f9cb19c234c4a1431cc3f40fe36af293cb4c883d185a7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"last hope","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"最后的希望"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"770de4cede8c037636436677ba338adf9b0938f6d4a66e85604de975651b96b0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3e6a32cb1bcaab9706996ff1c582e0b8d852ad4ff7a7980aa0709d9eebd2da3","logical_entry_identity":"8e5e3e03345ece6fc096212f58ce79f6605e2a6a00cc9c27d0f92e0d42c5b0c3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Epoch's Curve","source_tag":"entity name","target":"亚伯契的弧线"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e574c0c1f0669bc23b746bc2825a30d3ab3a9c3716b82a77f9f4e38fcc430613","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3e8ed5f66ccb18b93122847de65d5e6bc4dc31313c79374927fad544ebdaa69","logical_entry_identity":"cbf154d4e1a01d275e2b73c3082af8da7007a931bbf653b4d33d8bf4bdaf59af","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"lightning daze melee","source_tag":"entity name","target":"近战闪电眩晕伤害"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"686f63a2c207a306cee490a7f6995a3534f12be0d4750a5f3c24caffbf8c5519","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3eff9435211ccfe8c2c8376e0cfaaa70b7a326ae181cee0ecb6669fcbf752f5","logical_entry_identity":"c7effcbc3fa170892dec53582046cbc99b62dfad12ef0f8a2d7d6f08c4d11a15","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"-Mana Overflow","source_tag":"_t","target":"-法力溢出"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"86230fb56ce82573e599c72d1e6282e18721a896131816e965920ed2f98de80f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a3f2577005861d57b834d12cb974727b5175d8db75c5b47317392ea9b8819c4c","logical_entry_identity":"d08f3352d03e82c100873d996e2103ae4a