ion_identity":"a4020946f2621c485ca962b859f7985acec24482f2f4e4911af27b5ff57f2380","logical_entry_identity":"219467ccc2e61b2cdaf91aec50471e6299a98ef40f094bea617855c4700bbeb4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Thick skin hangs loosely from this short, shambling form. Tufts of hair sticking out from its chin give evidence of a once magnificent dwarven beard. Half its face seems to have been seared in acid at some point, the flesh melted away from the skull and an eyeball drooping low from its socket. There is a unique sadness to its eyes, and a slump of resignation to its gait.\nWhat proud hero of renown was this before he was condemned to such a terrible fate?","source_tag":"_t","target":"在你面前的是一只步履蹒跚、肌肉松弛的——怪物。从他下巴中伸出的浓密胡须以及他的毛发来看，这是一位矮人。看起来他的半边脸曾经被硫酸泼过，血肉从他的脸部脱落，其中一只眼睛从它的眼窝中掉了出来。他的独眼有一种莫名的悲伤，透露着深深的无奈。如此威风的英雄人物怎会落得如此下场？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be6fcdd1e62c8456ba6e35614bf2be657aa427938deba31af865450ce48c1eb2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a402c54078db15b33ca321606eb15076e98902de0a0b0aed48f11a54d7cd8b20","logical_entry_identity":"41fef8c2e1c18562854edef03d97a2ddc1fe03587d0daeff647999bebcde6877","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#Source# consumes %d life from #Target#!","source_tag":"logCombat","target":"#Source#从#Target#身上吸取了%d生命！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"42e3e1915cc12d6278a987ce93d77cae912e565aba040b1376bbb62f80018e1a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a40469e4c9795d8ed60e9b7765c93a4b832f8f59ea6d96e697db0e804ebc7196","logical_entry_identity":"1211bee6365320a693aa873bfe20b8b5ac0b8058ca9165f36259b8f1ddfb261d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Alchemists can transmute gems to bring forth elemental effects, turning them into balls of fire, torrents of acid, and other effects.  They can also reinforce armour with magical effects using gems, and channel arcane staffs to produce bolts of energy.","source_tag":"_t","target":"炼金术士可以将元素力量输入各种宝石，使它们变成火球、酸液和其他效果。另外他们也可以利用宝石来强化装甲并使用法杖发射能量球。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3b54b9a7ff38475c4138dc40eb50fd716f894c388e49ec6938031b261ace97c4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a406644d3b4f27dd06d92d57250cf2a9be6a715438e36e7deddd7f4b3a83b573","logical_entry_identity":"7e11c324a11d6fe874adb6351cef7d77fde6d0286761acbe6e75c94b6ac640d1","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Halflings are a race of very short stature, rarely exceeding four feet in height.","source_tag":"_t","target":"半身人是一个身材十分矮小的种族，高度很少有超过 4 英尺。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b9aaff48814ce674591a79d793f2b7227e56ea845bc6430eb568eccd1ac5b533","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a40ff50a87db92e0d267f9ee930cf4e1aeae3a03e8b5f3229ada60dc623ba8b6","logical_entry_identity":"42185d24904155af5b57a9625ddc4886bc80be382f66f3ee990b69593099adb9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"+Energy","source_tag":"_t","target":"+能量"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"14032278e4612da611599b3e0c56749bdb4c4e63dce4595e5dae155dfdb0ff4b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a416b0f3d18eaad8875fa99febf50947ae8fa0bbaeadedd93e4dc95f287b0055","logical_entry_identity":"b6dc76647f8f64c6a2524c5d986c867352756a3d32b4e85117212c1dfc7b1fa9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ah, excellent. Hand them over, if you please. You should know that in your overlong absence, %s has managed to create a %s. I'll be most put out if he steals my rightful spot.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"啊，太好了。请把它们交给我吧。要知道，在你离开的漫长时间里，%s已经设法配制出了一瓶%s。要是他抢走了本该属于我的席位，我可会非常不悦。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e7abc48a6c1d48d3cd5b0ee602851ef8acedfa7e1362177fb3c60774f6e306a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a41b519b9ac9b5a1e384baf953457cd2e2a08b8536f48f6ad198c2bb8f7bf140","logical_entry_identity":"674d2c01fa58a5a0c67f74d1c379b314be3220c666820291fa7448f967b07aea","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Uncontrolled anger","source_tag":"_t","target":"无边愤怒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d104245a2d5b553d7f33f82d8ba4d30af004a0179d4546f22c7a6948dd1df64c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a41bdae6818f0b1a2848dfc86e1f0d13b773125eac483f28fa4b1d003df6752f","logical_entry_identity":"3ffe70f98b38ca88eb02527b0b45dd5150f338908e3b8257109951c6be3cd986","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gnaw","source_tag":"talent name","target":"啃噬"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bdd5fec624acaf9b16ac09dbfe4b0e25c4f4a2b4ca6ecc79b6448588a0ad83ab","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a41c0f7fdf0198386e4dec6a3f9e5873627dcda605176f1deae9898c0077f289","logical_entry_identity":"46069667780cad160fef5a2369f469371c57c0de43dc47789d2d0bffd7e35c79","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You'll need to find one with a ring, preferably an expensive one.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你要寻找一个带有圆环的，最好是贵一些的那种。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5e155e6e9a16c717008ff446de744e1acc5ba30d84d72780345ee8783fd62224","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a429f22782b5cdcf35f48b191b78d2953ee7f682d2d900e75ff34ffecc1595bf","logical_entry_identity":"c2cdcaded3ad7cfdcfa9523779e16ace4c15800372116ae855b980388c4b75a4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Orcs were spotted with the staff you seek in an arid waste in the southern desert.","source_tag":"_t","target":"有人看到兽人带着你所寻找的法杖，出现在南部沙漠的一片干旱荒地中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7eddc3950ef5f0f40e29b8f85aff34ed400fa297ead0e990e52edffdd2fbaad4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a42affd48ea1328d4ef01a600938ce57bdbeac93284a86633236c519b1a5b41a","logical_entry_identity":"51b799cb6a5b71f45322e213da253df6513da845832ee5ff98041eb57c546afb","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A terrible robed undead figure, this creature has existed in its unlife for many centuries by stealing the life of others.\nIt can summon the very shades of its victims from beyond the grave to come enslaved to its aid.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个身披长袍的可怕不死生物，靠窃取他人的生命在亡者之身中存在了数百年。\n它能从坟墓彼端召唤受害者的阴影，使其臣服前来协助自己。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d1bee9c15019f8cdee617f356c674f47dd39e4bf8278a67436f586e58199cb7b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a42b38edab3decc1c574e38aaea356ae3243b46f5b1798d1bcf951847fe67068","logical_entry_identity":"7ad29d670d2c8cb22f831978db758e9ec79ca976c644991e02dfa92417feb034","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hide in Plain Sight","source_tag":"talent name","target":"强制潜行"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f632f5382075d8ccd2437253d84b4cbc2528675e801dab09545457b3afe58c0a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a42ca0e2b1099d88629842eed97977ee90069fa8be22c583a749fa1fde395c90","logical_entry_identity":"5f353efab941436a172a4c6e186cc1185ea50976b80607923140100ffc9eeecd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Dwarf skin is a complex structure; it can automatically react to physical blows and harden itself.\n\t\tWhen you are hit in melee, you have a 15%% chance to increase your armour total by %d for 5 turns and fully ignore the attack triggering it.\n\t\tThere is no cooldown to this effect; it can happen while already active.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"矮人皮肤是一种复杂的结构，它可以在受到打击后自动硬化。\n\t\t当你被近战攻击击中时有 15%% 的概率增加 %d 点护甲值，持续 5 回合，同时无视触发该效果的攻击。\n\t\t该效果无冷却时间，可重复触发。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0d16f96ed3928f550b8b0a6b1bdc745ef9301fe4c1b0043d133178360bb1b4e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a42ca99e8683d7151e32434b487c76d970a6ffd4680141541a5377353a78a0aa","logical_entry_identity":"6865b0d8dc94d21bed2e18a7a708e12ac06eb5ed433b90956300051d94d57905","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Reduces the cooldown of the selected chronomancy spell by %d%%.\n\t\tEach spell can only be spellbound in one way at a time.\n\t\t\n\t\tCurrent Matrix Spell: %s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"强化指定的时空系法术，减少指定法术的冷却时间 %d%%。\n\t\t每个技能只能附加一种时空增效系效果。\n\t\t当前强化法术：%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"0bdeae903a82785acda3472b27f1de6f48081e5e7ef8f98dccea421a490a807b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4311c31781b73be6235222bb04702ac0dfc76a444295243bbe8d764ef1cbaf8","logical_entry_identity":"1e09f21e73a3a1d102d5262ad3fee08f2b4f7deb0d41456acbf3ec426195fca9","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A ghostly figure.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个隐约的形象。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dd868f49f70b43a848b4858f4196364debb8178902df4f104b8b2d586750d6cc","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a43181ee6184da2d9f4a98c20bc7acb1a87aa4da1b171b650304d973654e0c65","logical_entry_identity":"f6ee4506128c85de67911dfc87e31fdf033b4d6fee8ad90fb5c1abb7254e50d6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As the only immortal race of Eyal, Shaloren have learnt over the long years to use their innate inner magic to protect themselves.\n\t\t%d%% chance to become invisible (power %d) for 5 turns when hit by a blow doing at least 10%% of your total life.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"作为埃亚尔唯一的不朽种族，永恒精灵在漫长岁月中学会了运用与生俱来的内在魔力保护自己。\n\t\t当一次攻击造成至少 10%% 总生命值的伤害时，有 %d%% 概率进入隐形状态（强度 %d），持续 5 回合。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5a3fe6c076c016e3c74843247f9e9355140a32dd0eccb349f875771bf503743e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a4356eeec227cdd73ec82378c81a973cd0802e0102763451c3b68deedef39764","logical_entry_identity":"77259e6a1a821930d23e60f8a33ad3f717c013cfb5d575a5b6bbd07a836c3b22","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"range %d","source_tag":"logPlayer","target":"范围 %d"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6cf0b79c593b64943779c4b03e2a3e23ad1cffd4c195fcb653f4b651d89c854","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a438d429d63bb27773e188c830e7c7cbb71eefab8a230f9fe38c4b582afbaed4","logical_entry_identity":"b49246405435227d080776e70834dc602dd57f0ea66ec92b9dd482118db2f25f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"White Mustache","source_tag":"_t","target":"白色八字胡"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"381322ef3f23d2f84da4f99136034ff6a8548ce16094f23a23edf8d4afc8b0cf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"a43ddb9046ee3b78306bee0caaf7e01bd4c55c041e8db058e5263319e4d52b9a","logical_entry_identity":"d383a0af1187f5b4206d77d7ee79ad036f9a698115b8a28c1